// negative seed: pack source injecting parser keywords.
//
// Seeded silent-success: a field_pack body claims a `keywords:` section
// — a lexer/keyword injection. The section table for `field_pack` is
// closed (exports/metadata only); a mutant that silently ignores the
// unknown section (or desugars the pack into a custom declaration that
// then falls through to strict lowering) would look like a successful
// pack admission while the pack smuggled parser surface in.
# expect: refuse E-SYN-101 (section `keywords` is not admitted for kind `field_pack`)

package community

emath field_pack injector:
    exports:
        cell softmax
    keywords:
        add match
